Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Evaluate a robust median combination on the full model pool to see if it outperforms the weighted mean.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a trimmed‐mean combination on the full pool to see if trimming extreme errors improves over median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a robust iterative DBA combination on the full model pool to see if it improves over the median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool_full","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the pooled meta-model weights (w1) on the full pool to see if a learned weighting improves over inverse error and median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool_full","weights":"w1"}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy on the top-ranked model ONLY_FT_rf to see if a single strong model outperforms the robust combinations.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_FT_rf"}

Thought: Test a simple mean on the reduced pool1 to see if a tighter subset improves the median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a robust median combination on the tighter pool1 to see if it beats the full‑pool median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the tighter pool1 using inverse_error weights to see if a more focused weighted scheme outperforms the median baseline.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool2 using inverse_error to see if a slightly larger pool improves over the current median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool2","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on the tighter pool1 using the existing w4 handle to see if a different subset improves the best score.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"w4"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on pool1 to see if iterative weighting improves over median/weighted.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

